Docker Command

Stop 
docker stop smartserve-container
docker rm smartserve-container

ReRun
docker compose down
docker compose up --build

Run 
docker run -d -p 8080:8080 -e ASPNETCORE_URLS=http://+:8080 --name smartserve-container smartserve-api
docker run -d -p 8080:8080 -e ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development -e ASPNETCORE_URLS=http://+:8080 --name smartserve-container smartserve-api


ReDeploy
docker rm -f smartserve-container
docker build --no-cache -t smartserve-api .
docker run -d -p 8080:8080 -e ASPNETCORE_URLS=http://+:8080 --name smartserve-container smartserve-api